| !@APP@: a sample from the OpenGL ES 2.0 Programming Guide, built unchanged
| against riscos-mesa with its esUtil_RISCOS.c (a desktop window through
| native EGL). Escape or the close icon quits. Text output (the FPS report)
| goes to the file Output here; its newest line is shown in the title bar.
Set ESUtil$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set ESUtil$Output /|<ESUtil$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !@APP@ needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !@APP@ needs ARMEABISupport
Run <ESUtil$Dir>.!RunImage
